---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="A-Level Exam Technique | Free AO1, AO2, AO3 Breakdown"
  description="Complete A-Level exam technique guide with AO1, AO2, AO3 breakdown. Free download for A-Level students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>A-Level<br><span>Exam Technique</span></h1>
    <p>AO1, AO2, AO3 breakdown. Maximize your A-Level score with proven techniques.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Assessment Objectives</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>AO1: Knowledge & Understanding</h3>
        <pre><code>• Define key terms accurately
• State relevant theories and models
• Describe processes and procedures
• Use correct terminology
• Show breadth of knowledge

Tip&#58; Use bullet points for definitions</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>AO2: Application</h3>
        <pre><code>• Apply knowledge to specific scenarios
• Use examples to illustrate points
• Connect theory to real-world contexts
• Show how concepts relate
• Demonstrate understanding of context

Tip&#58; "This means that..." or "In this case..."</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>AO3: Analysis & Evaluation</h3>
        <pre><code>• Analyze evidence and arguments
• Evaluate strengths and limitations
• Consider multiple perspectives
• Make justified judgments
• Support with evidence

Tip&#58; "However..." or "On the other hand..."</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Question Types</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Short Answer (1-4 marks)</h3>
        <pre><code>• State one/two/four points
• Use bullet points
• Be concise and precise
• No need for evaluation
• Focus on AO1</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Medium Answer (6-9 marks)</h3>
        <pre><code>• Include AO1 and AO2
• Use paragraphs
• Include examples
• Show connections
• Brief evaluation</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Extended Answer (12-25 marks)</h3>
        <pre><code>• Full AO1, AO2, AO3
• Structured essay format
• Multiple examples
• Balanced evaluation
• Clear conclusion</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Time Management</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Exam Timing</h3>
        <pre><code>• 1.5 marks per minute
• Plan&#58; 1 mark = ~40 seconds
• Read question carefully (30 sec)
• Plan answer (1 min for 6 marks)
• Write answer
• Check units and sig figs</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
